{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Open World in a Post-Apocalyptic World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse zombie-infested lost towns, cross perilous snowy plains, and infiltrate mysterious military bases\u2026 Eight distinctly styled regions await (and maybe more). Each area presents unique hazards and mechanics. Scavenge vital resources to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/1.\u641c\u522e-\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Awaken Your Powers to Battle the Bizarreness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 items and 50+ special supernatural abilities. Customize your weapons to the max to build the ultimate end-times loadout. Face off against powerful bosses with unique mechanics. Fight the bizarre world with bizarre powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/2\u6253boss.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Form Your Legion for an Unbeatable Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rally every survivor you can find, be they NPCs, former foes, or even the good boys of the \u201cWoof Pack\u201d! Lead up to 30 companions into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>P.S. Co-op supported, double your companions with a friend, and never fear the zombie hordes again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/4\u4f1a\u5e08.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Zombie-Powered Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Few people remain in the apocalypse, but zombies are in abundant supply. Exploit their labor to create your base of operations. Leap from hands-on farming straight into electrified automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/3\u519c\u573a.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Dusk-Time Party Painted by Rust-Tinged Pixels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixels of rusty reds and warm oranges blend to bring this post-apocalyptic world to life. Let the fantasy-filled dusk party begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/5\u9ec4\u660f.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2975680?t=1749528193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/58bab00eb71647ed6422c78641ffebafcad99b87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749528193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/8509805a528ffcfe2171bdeacec819bb74a7d831/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749528193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/8509805a528ffcfe2171bdeacec819bb74a7d831/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749528193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains cartoon-style bloody scenes of zombie killing and zombie disintegration."},"detailed_description":"<h1>DEMO NOW OUT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For\u00a0more\u00a0game\u00a0updates\u00a0and\u00a0feedback,\u00a0please\u00a0join\u00a0our\u00a0discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Open World in a Post-Apocalyptic World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse zombie-infested lost towns, cross perilous snowy plains, and infiltrate mysterious military bases\u2026 Eight distinctly styled regions await (and maybe more). Each area presents unique hazards and mechanics. Scavenge vital resources to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/1.\u641c\u522e-\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Awaken Your Powers to Battle the Bizarreness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 items and 50+ special supernatural abilities. Customize your weapons to the max to build the ultimate end-times loadout. Face off against powerful bosses with unique mechanics. Fight the bizarre world with bizarre powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/2\u6253boss.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Form Your Legion for an Unbeatable Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rally every survivor you can find, be they NPCs, former foes, or even the good boys of the \u201cWoof Pack\u201d! Lead up to 30 companions into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>P.S. Co-op supported, double your companions with a friend, and never fear the zombie hordes again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/4\u4f1a\u5e08.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Zombie-Powered Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Few people remain in the apocalypse, but zombies are in abundant supply. Exploit their labor to create your base of operations. Leap from hands-on farming straight into electrified automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/3\u519c\u573a.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Dusk-Time Party Painted by Rust-Tinged Pixels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixels of rusty reds and warm oranges blend to bring this post-apocalyptic world to life. Let the fantasy-filled dusk party begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/5\u9ec4\u660f.gif?t=1749528193\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u72fc\u732b\u6e38\u620f / Wolfy Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/23884f1dba8751de17dd2c84aef1e042c7e0a076/header.jpg?t=1749528193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257020372,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257020372/movie480.mp4?t=1715728255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257020372/movie_max.mp4?t=1715728255"},"name":"\u6e38\u620f\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257020372/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1715728255","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257020372/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1715728255","max":"http://video.akam